          "raw_description": "Smallish bookstore with three aisles formed by bookshelves; a single wood-panel counter/register near the entrance. Brown-stained wood shelves; terry green walls with brown-stained wood trim. Books all hardcover with no slip covers; matte red/green/chocolate brown spines with gold foil lettering; looked like printed between the 1930s–50s. Some reference books and some novels. Organized so each shelf had the exact same size and color of book; no empty spaces suggesting any book had been taken. Gave an 'outdated and out of place' vibe."
